From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 14:41:24 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] ios: share runtime for new shell games beside existing FH
 games

Reuse route C preparation for separate FS host and game images. New shell games always use the shared runtime, while existing FH games keep their embedded host.

Front-ends: FS games need the matching shared runtime descriptor and shader chain in the existing shell loader.

Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: Shared runtime for new shell builds while preserving existing FH artifacts and current fork shell integration.
Issue: none (owner-requested shared runtime work)

